      "note": [
        "Construction cost index for multi-dwelling buildings and collectively built one- or two-dwelling buildings 2004 = 100 won’t be published anymore. We refer you rather use 1968 = 100 or 2015 = 100 instead. If you still want to follow index 2004 = 100 you can use the following conversion rates. Multiply the index 2015 = 100 and the conversion rates to convert the index to 2004 = 100.\r\n\r\n\r\nConstruction cost index for multi-dwelling buildings:\r\n\r\nTotal Construction cost index                               1,388\r\n\r\nMaterials                                                                1,496\r\nLabour, wage drift excluded                                  1,304\r\nPlant and equipment                                             1,258\r\nTransport, energy                                                   1,365\r\nContractor’s other costs                                         1,333\r\nContractor’s cost                                                    1,407\r\nClients other cost                                                   1,198\r\n\r\nConstruction cost index for collectively built one- or two-dwelling buildings except owner-occupied buildings:\r\n\r\nTotal Construction cost index                                1,355\r\n\r\nMaterials                                                                1,444\r\nLabour, wage drift excluded                                  1,305\r\nPlant and equipment                                             1,258\r\nTransport, energy                                                   1,349\r\nContractor’s other costs                                         1,315\r\nContractor’s cost                                                    1,372\r\nClients other cost                                                   1,247",
        "Reviderade indextal avseende flerbostadshus och gruppbyggda småhus. Gäller för oktober 2009 avseende Total faktorprisindex, Material och Entreprenörens kostnad."
      ],
